WEBVTT

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:01.910
but she was telling me backstage 
that she had a problem.

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:02.860
E: What's the matter?

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:05.411
SW: No, I don't have a problem. 
You have the problem, remember?

00:03:05.411 --> 00:03:07.517
You were saying 
that you were really embarrassed,

00:03:07.517 --> 00:03:09.520
because you're in love with a pirate?

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:10.510
E: Yar.

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:13.670
SW: There we go. And what do
pirates like to drink?

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:14.560
E: Beer.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:15.638
SW: Yeah, that's right.

00:03:15.638 --> 00:03:17.490
But you don't like to drink beer, 
Einstein.

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:18.700
You like to drink water.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:19.800
E: [Water sound]

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:22.590
SW: Very good. Now, really,
she is pretty nervous.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:25.580
Because one of her favorite folks 
from back home is here,

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:27.320
and she's pretty nervous to meet him.

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:30.970
She thinks Al Gore 
is a really good-looking man.